Package: bootpq
Title: Bootstrapping by Rarefaction Permutations for 'phyloseq' Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Adrien", "Taudière", , "adrien.taudiere@zaclys.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1088-1182"))
Description: Bootstrapping tools for 'phyloseq' objects based on
    repeated rarefaction to even sequencing depth. Statistical analyses
    (PERMANOVA, Hill-number group tests, and variation partitioning) are
    computed across many rarefaction permutations, each with a different
    random seed, and summarized to reduce the risk of drawing conclusions
    from a single, possibly atypical, rarefaction. Part of the 'pqverse'
    ecosystem and built on top of 'MiscMetabar'.
